tate":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"60"},"weight":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"48"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"• Zodiac sign: Scorpio"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"A preceptor of a Hospital University who became Takuya's senpai when he was transferred to internal medicine for training."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is gentle to children, elders, and female patients, but she often shows her sadistic side to any male with no hesitation, even to Takuya, who often is teased during lessons. Regardless, she can take good care of others and is known to be very reliable during work."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"As the president's niece of the Amagi Hospital University, she was assigned as a doctor supervisor even though she was young and inexperienced."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Edited from Steam"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c78320"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公の大学時代の先輩であり、研修で内科に異動した際の指導医。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"子供、お年寄り、女性には優しい女医先生だが、男性に対してはサディスティックな一面を惜しげもなく見せてくる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"それは後輩である主人公でも例外ではなく、指導中でもちょくちょく言葉責めなどを混ぜる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"だが面倒見の良い性格でもあるため、基本的にはとても頼れる先輩である。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"天城大学病院の理事長の姪であることもあり、まだ若手ではあるが指導医として抜擢された。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"本人はイジメ甲斐のある後輩が来ると言うことで、内心で楽しみにしている。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"20740","sourceWorkId":"27578","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公の大学時代の先輩であり、研修で内科に異動した際の指導医。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"子供、お年寄り、女性には優しい女医先生だが、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"男性に対してはサディスティックな一面を惜しげもなく見せてくる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"それは後輩である主人公でも例外ではなく、指導中でもちょくちょく言葉責めなどを混ぜる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"だが面倒見の良い性格でもあるため、基本的にはとても頼れる先輩である。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"天城大学病院の理事長の姪であることもあり、まだ若手ではあるが指導医として抜擢された。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"本人はイジメ甲斐のある後輩が来ると言うことで、内心で楽しみにしている。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"68629"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"星座","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"68629","value":"さそり座"}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/91/91f427da5e2659a2b6a72ee167cf1d76fc8ae818bde5cd32f771ea92b6a3e37c.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/fa/fabda24de9e204b9b41c96ff5fe166e23d53ce914aea159467a1df73c25725df.webp","width":83,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"藤沢れい香","creatorId":"vndb:s14338","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s14338","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s14338","name":"藤沢 れい香","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:269859:68629:32998:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c67272","characterName":"赤木 澪","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c67272"},"originalCharacterName":"赤木 澪","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"831"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"b"},"cupSize":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"F"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"160"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Height: Slightly reaching 160cm"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Weight: Secret (nurse is a hard worker, so she's quite muscular...)"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Three size: I will leave it to your imagination *grin*"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Bust: Secret (F cup—according a colleague nurse)"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Waist: Secret (Once boasted about being 60cm—according a colleague nurse)"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Zodiac: Virgo"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Mio is a \"veteran\" nurse who has been working in the hospital for 2 years. She is very popular with staff and patients, regardless of their age, especially because of her kindness and altruism towards others: Elderly people like her to accompany them for rehabilitation sessions and children love to play with her or annoy her by raising her skirt. However, although it is appreciated by many people and that she is very competent, Mio is very clumsy and is often reprimanded and put back by the head nurse who blames her for her lack of professionalism."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Mio spent all of her childhood and adolescence with Takuya, her best friend, whether outside or at school because they were often in the same class as well as being neighbors. Average student, Takuya helped her all the time doing her homework because he was a brilliant student who wanted to become a pediatrician. Wanting to follow a similar path as Takuya, Mio then began studying to become a nurse and she was successful in obtaining her diploma after 4 years of intense studies. She hasn't seen Takuya since the end of high school, but that didn't prevent her from recognizing him at first sight when she saw him six years later in the hospital hall."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Taking advantage of this unexpected chance to see him again, Mio and Takuya renew their ties when they have free time. One day, while they are talking up the stairs, a young boy jostles Mio who loses her balance. Takuya then grasps her hand and accompanies her in her fall, while protecting her in his arms and losing consciousness once down the stairs. He then wakes up in a hospital bed with the right arm and left leg broken. Feeling guilty, Mio asks him to ask her anything in exchange. Takuya then asks her if she can ask to take care of the room where he resides the time of his recovery."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"His request being accepted, Mio and Takuya start together the adventure of their life."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c67272"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/dd/ddbecb9b6f701392db9b8260027588f67f9de0d5b3f293f0ae891d2458dea334.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/07/07c59221378bb92d8ef30599513c23ee037dc4ea59ba16cdbc845e0a90d1008b.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"五行 なずな","creatorId":"vndb:s367","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s367","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s367","name":"小野 涼子","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:80169","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c78567","characterName":"白沢 卓也","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c78567"},"originalCharacterName":"白沢 卓也","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Takuya is in his 6th year of medical school and just started practicing at the hospital to become an independent pediatrician. As soon as he arrives in the hospital hall, he sees a crying little girl so he decides to see if she's fine. Arrived at the girl, Takuya suddenly meets a young nurse about his age who has also come to see the little girl. After osculating the girl, Takuya realizes that the young nurse is not unfamiliar to him at all because she is in fact his childhood friend Mio with whom he spent all his youth and adolescence with."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"After 6 years without seeing each other, Takuya and Mio renew their ties as soon as they have the time. One day, while they are talking up the stairs, a young boy jostles Mio who loses her balance. Takuya then grasps her hand and accompanies her in her fall, while protecting her in his arms and losing consciousness once down the stairs. He then wakes up in a hospital bed with the right arm and left leg broken. Feeling guilty, Mio asks him to ask her anything in exchange. Takuya then asks her if she can ask to take care of the room where he resides the time of his recovery."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"His request being accepted, Mio and Takuya start together the adventure of their life."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c78567"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/92/924a0bb3240979532beb384c4e870ebfd71a430da14db18239c56caee20ccc26.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/29/29c5cb2fb789c7686c01c8d2dd89176b7437c45b0d03cc3548eda08288602206.webp","width":205,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]}],"songs":[],"companies":[{"companyId":"vndb:p6066","sourceCompanyId":"egs:brand:781","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p6066","name":"エンターグラム","roleCodes":["brand"],"identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-brand:28821:781","source":"egs"},{"companyId":"vndb:p6066","sourceCompanyId":"vndb:p6066","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p6066","name":"株式会社エンターグラム","roleCodes":["publisher"],"identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:release-producer:100061:v24916","source":"vndb"},{"companyId":"vndb:p6978","sourceCompanyId":"vndb:p6978","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p6978","name":"プレカノ","roleCodes":["developer"],"identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:release-producer:100062:v24916","source":"vndb"},{"companyId":"vndb:p6066","sourceCompanyId":"vndb:p6066","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p6066","name":"株式会社エンターグラム","roleCodes":["publisher"],"identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:release-producer:100063:v24916","source":"vndb"},{"companyId":"vndb:p6978","sourceCompanyId":"vndb:p6978","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p6978","name":"プレカノ","roleCodes":["developer"],"identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:release-producer:100064:v24916","source":"vndb"},{"companyId":"vndb:p6066","sourceCompanyId":"vndb:p6066","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p6066","name":"株式会社エンターグラム","roleCodes":["publisher"],"identityStatus":"source-nati